The MIT license above covers the marketplace metadata and tooling
(`marketplace.json`, this LICENSE, README.md, ATTRIBUTIONS.md). The
plugins inside `plugins/` carry their own licenses; see each plugin's
`LICENSE` file and the canonical attribution table in `ATTRIBUTIONS.md`.

Summary of bundled licenses:

- `plugins/kaizen/`           MIT          (© 2026 YugeIceCone)
  └ in-plugin bundles: coding-skills (MIT, Jordan Coin Jackson),
    superpowers (MIT, Jesse Vincent), remember (MIT, Gabi Fratica),
    workflow + onion-ddd-workflow + tdd (origin unconfirmed, assumed MIT)
    — see `plugins/kaizen/ATTRIBUTIONS.md` for full details.
- `plugins/*-lsp/`            Apache-2.0   (Anthropic — 12 plugins)
  └ each wraps a separately licensed upstream binary; see
    ATTRIBUTIONS.md "Upstream language-server binaries" for the
    per-plugin upstream license (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD-3-Clause,
    EPL-2.0, or proprietary in php-lsp's case).
